1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:16,514
All five situations from lessons six to ten — always three options and a full model dialogue with the examiner. Plus twelve phrases to reach agreement in any situation, and five mistakes that cost people points. Get ready and speak out loud!

2
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:34,374
How does task 4 work? The examiner describes a situation and shows three options. You suggest one. She usually says she doesn’t like it — and you suggest another. In the end you agree and say why. You can get seven points for this task.

3
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:51,613
The dialogue has a simple plan. You suggest one option. The examiner says why not. You calmly suggest another. And when she asks why, you answer: protože. Now let’s go through all five situations. Speak yourself first, then you hear the model.

4
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,156
Situation 6: A friend is moving to a new flat.

5
00:00:56,467 --> 00:01:06,818
A friend is moving into a new flat. What shall we buy him? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

6
00:01:19,533 --> 00:01:21,092
We could buy him a plant.

7
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:23,772
He doesn't like plants, he doesn't look after them.

8
00:01:24,067 --> 00:01:25,500
Then let's buy him a picture.

9
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,264
A picture is too expensive.

10
00:01:27,567 --> 00:01:28,953
Then let's buy him some mugs.

11
00:01:29,267 --> 00:01:30,685
Why do you want to buy that?

12
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,837
Because he likes coffee and everyone needs mugs.

13
00:01:34,133 --> 00:01:37,385
OK, that's a practical present. Let's buy him mugs.

14
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:41,640
Situation 7: On Sunday we want to go on a trip with the kids.

15
00:01:41,933 --> 00:01:49,286
On Sunday we want to go on a trip with the children. Where shall we go? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

16
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,521
We could go to the zoo.

17
00:02:03,833 --> 00:02:05,544
We went to the zoo last month.

18
00:02:05,833 --> 00:02:07,094
Then let's go to a castle.

19
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:10,112
The castle is far away and the children will be tired.

20
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:12,044
Then let's go to the water park.

21
00:02:12,333 --> 00:02:13,850
And why there?

22
00:02:14,133 --> 00:02:17,387
Because the children love swimming and they won't be bored at the water park.

23
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,962
You're right. Let's go to the water park.

24
00:02:20,267 --> 00:02:24,389
Situation 8: We want to do something for our health together.

25
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:32,488
We want to do something healthy together. What shall we do? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

26
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,192
We could do yoga together.

27
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:48,608
Yoga is boring.

28
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:50,535
Then let's go for walks.

29
00:02:50,833 --> 00:02:52,458
I don't have time for walks.

30
00:02:52,767 --> 00:02:54,249
Then let's eat healthily.

31
00:02:54,533 --> 00:02:55,980
And why do you want this?

32
00:02:56,267 --> 00:02:59,669
Because we can do it every day and we don't need extra time for it.

33
00:02:59,967 --> 00:03:01,539
OK, we'll eat healthily.

34
00:03:01,833 --> 00:03:05,765
Situation 9: We want to learn something new together.

35
00:03:06,067 --> 00:03:15,361
We want to learn something new together. What shall we learn? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

36
00:03:28,067 --> 00:03:29,741
We could learn English.

37
00:03:30,033 --> 00:03:31,507
I already speak English.

38
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,244
Then let's go to driving school.

39
00:03:33,533 --> 00:03:35,216
Driving school is too expensive.

40
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:37,905
Then let's learn to use a computer.

41
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,429
And why do you want that?

42
00:03:39,733 --> 00:03:42,157
Because we need computers both at work and at home.

43
00:03:42,467 --> 00:03:44,889
That's true. We'll take a computer course.

44
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:48,567
Situation 10: A friend is celebrating her birthday.

45
00:03:48,867 --> 00:03:56,021
Our friend is celebrating her birthday. Where shall we have the party? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

46
00:04:08,733 --> 00:04:10,437
We could have the party at home.

47
00:04:10,733 --> 00:04:12,315
There isn't much room at home.

48
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,333
Then let's have the party in the park.

49
00:04:14,633 --> 00:04:15,996
It will be cold in the park.

50
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,184
Then let's have the party in a restaurant.

51
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:19,753
And why there?

52
00:04:20,067 --> 00:04:22,230
Because we won't have to cook or clean up there.

53
00:04:22,533 --> 00:04:26,320
OK, that's a good idea. The party will be at the restaurant.

54
00:04:26,633 --> 00:04:32,452
Now twelve phrases to reach agreement in any situation. Listen and repeat out loud.

55
00:04:33,167 --> 00:04:34,467
We could go to the cinema.

56
00:04:37,667 --> 00:04:39,100
What if we went to the mountains?

57
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:43,600
How about pizza?

58
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,300
Then let’s go to a restaurant.

59
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,500
OK, then we’ll cook goulash.

60
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:59,067
You’re right, the theatre is expensive.

61
00:05:02,267 --> 00:05:03,898
That’s a pity, but never mind.

62
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:08,800
I’d rather go to the seaside.

63
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,564
Because swimming is healthy.

64
00:05:16,767 --> 00:05:18,633
The cinema is cheap and close.

65
00:05:21,833 --> 00:05:24,532
I agree, that’s a good idea.

66
00:05:27,733 --> 00:05:28,959
It’ll be fun.

67
00:05:32,167 --> 00:05:35,225
Five typical mistakes that cost people points.

68
00:05:38,433 --> 00:05:45,878
Correct: Co kdybychom šli do kina? Make suggestions in full sentences: Můžeme…, Co kdybychom…

69
00:05:49,567 --> 00:05:56,813
Correct: Dobře, tak půjdeme do divadla. When the examiner disagrees, suggest another option.

70
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:07,774
Correct: Protože plavání je zdravé a bazén je blízko. At the end give a concrete reason: protože…

71
00:06:11,467 --> 00:06:19,899
Correct: Chceš jet na hory? In task 4 you talk to a friend: use the informal “ty” — máš, chceš, můžeš.

72
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:30,921
Correct: Půjdeme do kina. After do use the genitive: do kina, do divadla, do restaurace.

73
00:06:32,133 --> 00:06:50,057
Summary. First: make suggestions in full sentences. Second: when the examiner disagrees, suggest another option. Third: at the end give a reason — protože. And fourth: with a friend you use “ty”.

74
00:06:51,267 --> 00:07:02,745
And you? Where would you go on holiday — the seaside, the mountains or a city? Write it in the comments as a full sentence and say why. And if the video helped, give it a like.

75
00:07:03,933 --> 00:07:20,236
On the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website you can practise all situations for free — the site plays the examiner. Link in the description. Tomorrow: big review of Writing — the form and the e-mail. Subscribe so you don’t miss anything.
